(text "ISOLATED G5V-1 SIX PIN CANDIDATE ONLY, COM 5+6: NC contact grounds amplifier input with coil unpowered. NO contact routes volume when deliberately energized. NO OEM relay MPN, coil driver or power-good; 1k R1902 series COM-to-input plus 100k shunt reduces floating input but DOES NOT protect against welded NO or lost AF_GND; no PCB, no safety approval, NO FAB / NO TX." (at 93.98 205.74 0)(effects (font (size 1 1)))(uuid "867c0000-0000-4000-8000-000000000095"))
